WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.240 align:start position:19%
330 million light years
of absolutely nothing.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:14.560 align:start position:19%
Not dark matter,
not the empty space between stars,

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:18.240 align:start position:19%
an entire region of the universe
big enough to hold thousands of

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:23.360 align:start position:19%
galaxies,
and almost nobody is home.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:28.440 align:start position:19%
This is the Boötes void,
the emptiest place ever discovered,

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:33.560 align:start position:19%
and it might be the loneliest spot in
all of existence.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:36.640 align:start position:19%
Just think about this for a second.
Light, the fastest thing in the

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:43.080 align:start position:19%
universe,
traveling for 330 million years,

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:48.120 align:start position:19%
and for almost that entire journey, it
would pass nothing.

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:52.000 align:start position:19%
No stars, no planets,
no glowing clouds of gas,

